<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD is a premium marketplace and business platform for technology, electronics, African products, and global trade solutions."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0b0d" />
    <title>OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD | One World. Your Vision.</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0b0b0d;
        --bg-soft: #141416;
        --panel: #1a1a1d;
        --panel-alt: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        --gold: #d4af37;
        --gold-soft: #f3d77a;
        --text: #f5f5f5;
        --muted: #c7c4bf;
        --border: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.28);
        --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        --success: #25d366;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.12), transparent 25%),
          radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08), transparent 20%),
          var(--bg);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      a {
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 2rem));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        background: rgba(11, 11, 13, 0.82);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 76px;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-soft), var(--gold));
        color: #090909;
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.6rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .nav-links a:hover,
      .nav-links a:focus-visible {
        color: var(--gold-soft);
      }

      .nav-cta,
      .button,
      .whatsapp-float,
      .whatsapp-button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .nav-cta,
      .button.primary,
      .whatsapp-button {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-soft), var(--gold));
        color: #0d0d0d;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
      }

      .nav-cta {
        padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
      }

      .button,
      .whatsapp-button {
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .button:hover,
      .nav-cta:hover,
      .whatsapp-float:hover,
      .whatsapp-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .button.secondary {
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.06);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .highlight {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-soft), var(--gold));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      .lead {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        max-width: 640px;
      }

      .cta-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .stats {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .stat {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .stat strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.55rem;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      }

      .stat span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .hero-card {
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26, 26, 29, 0.96), rgba(15, 15, 17, 0.92));
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero-visual {
        min-height: 500px;
        padding: 1.2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        justify-content: center;
        background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.16), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)),
          url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      }

      .product-window {
        width: min(100%, 400px);
        background: rgba(8, 8, 10, 0.72);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 1.2rem;
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }

      .window-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .window-dots {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.45rem;
      }

      .window-dots span {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        display: block;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .window-dots span:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f57; }
      .window-dots span:nth-child(2) { background: #ffbd2f; }
      .window-dots span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--gold); }

      .product-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(120px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.85rem;
      }

      .mini-card {
        background: rgba(17, 17, 19, 0.85);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 0.9rem 0.85rem;
      }

      .mini-card strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--gold-soft);
      }

      .mini-card span {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
      }

      section {
        padding: 2.5rem 0;
      }

      .section-head {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      }

      .section-head h2 {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .section-head p {
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0;
      }

      .features,
      .categories,
      .services-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.3rem;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .icon {
        width: 52px;
        height: 52px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 14px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2), rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08));
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .card h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .cta-panel {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 2rem;
        border-radius: 24px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.09), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
      }

      .cta-panel h3 {
        margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      }

      .cta-panel p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .contact-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.8rem;
      }

      .contact-list li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .contact-dot {
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--gold);
        box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.8);
      }

      footer {
        padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
      }

      .whatsapp-float {
        position: fixed;
        right: 1.2rem;
        bottom: 1.2rem;
        width: 62px;
        height: 62px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #18d26a, #25d366);
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        z-index: 60;
      }

      @media (max-width: 880px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .features,
        .categories,
        .services-grid,
        .cta-panel {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          display: grid;
        }

        .nav-links {
          display: none;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 3rem;
        }

        .stats {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .cta-panel {
          padding: 1.5rem;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .nav {
          min-height: 68px;
        }

        .brand {
          font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .button,
        .nav-cta,
        .whatsapp-button {
          width: 100%;
        }

        .cta-row {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD home">
          <span class="brand-mark">O</span>
          <span>OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD</span>
        </a>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#products">Products</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact" aria-label="Contact OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">One World. Your Vision.</div>
            <h1>
              Premium global commerce for
              <span class="highlight">technology, trade, and lifestyle.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="lead">
              OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD connects customers and businesses to quality technology,
              supermarket essentials, authentic African products, and reliable logistics services
              across markets worldwide.
            </p>

            <div class="cta-row">
              <a class="button primary" href="#products">Explore Products</a>
              <a class="button secondary" href="#services">Our Services</a>
            </div>

            <div class="stats" aria-label="Business metrics">
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>Global</strong>
                <span>Market access</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>24/7</strong>
                <span>Customer support</span>
              </div>
              <div class="stat">
                <strong>Trusted</strong>
                <span>Delivery network</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-card" aria-label="Marketplace overview card">
            <div class="hero-visual">
              <div class="product-window">
                <div class="window-header">
                  <div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                  </div>
                  <span>Marketplace</span>
                </div>

                <div class="product-grid">
                  <div class="mini-card">
                    <strong>Tech</strong>
                    <span>Electronics</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mini-card">
                    <strong>Grocer</strong>
                    <span>Essentials</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mini-card">
                    <strong>Africa</strong>
                    <span>Heritage</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mini-card">
                    <strong>Logis</strong>
                    <span>Fast shipping</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>Connecting people to opportunity</h2>
            <p>
              We serve the modern buyer and growing business with a trusted digital marketplace
              built on quality, speed, and value.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="features">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📦</div>
              <h3>Curated quality</h3>
              <p>We focus on products and services that meet customer expectations for trust, value, and reliability.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🌍</div>
              <h3>Global reach</h3>
              <p>Our model supports international trade, supplier sourcing, and strong access to new market opportunities.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🚚</div>
              <h3>Reliable logistics</h3>
              <p>We help customers move goods smoothly with efficient fulfillment and dependable delivery support.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>What we do</h2>
            <p>Built to support modern businesses, buyers, and connected communities.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="services-grid">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">💻</div>
              <h3>Technology &amp; Electronics</h3>
              <p>Smart devices, connectivity tools, and modern digital solutions for personal and business use.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🛒</div>
              <h3>Supermarket Goods</h3>
              <p>Everyday essentials and home products selected for convenience, affordability, and practical living.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🌿</div>
              <h3>African Products</h3>
              <p>Unique cultural goods and authentic market offerings that celebrate heritage and identity.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="products">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>Why choose OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD</h2>
            <p>We help customers and partners access quality products and business opportunities with confidence.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="categories">
            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</div>
              <h3>Trust-first service</h3>
              <p>Built around clear communication, quality assurance, and customer-focused support.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</div>
              <h3>Business partnerships</h3>
              <p>Supporting trade relationships, supplier networks, and commercial opportunities across markets.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
              <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</div>
              <h3>Fast fulfillment</h3>
              <p>Quick response, organized logistics, and a practical delivery approach for customer satisfaction.</p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="cta-panel" id="contact">
            <div>
              <h3>Ready to connect?</h3>
              <p>Ask about products, international trade, logistics, or business partnerships.</p>
              <ul class="contact-list">
                <li><span class="contact-dot"></span> Email: olalekanb817@gmail.com</li>
                <li><span class="contact-dot"></span> Phone: +234 802 559 2137</li>
                <li><span class="contact-dot"></span> Location: Lagos, Nigeria</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <a
                class="whatsapp-button"
                href="https://wa.me/2348025592137?text=Hello%20OLAMILEKAN%20GLOBAL%20WORLD%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20make%20an%20enquiry."
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                aria-label="Chat with OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD on WhatsApp"
              >
                Chat on WhatsApp
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container">
        © <span id="year"></span> OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD. One World. Your Vision.
      </div>
    </footer>

    <a
      class="whatsapp-float"
      href="https://wa.me/2348025592137?text=Hello%20OLAMILEKAN%20GLOBAL%20WORLD%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20make%20an%20enquiry."
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="Chat with OLAMILEKAN GLOBAL WORLD on WhatsApp"
    >
      ✆
    </a>

    <script>
      document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
